cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use Dīvi, or publish results made with it, please cite it using these
  metadata. A journal article will replace this entry when it is published.
title: "Dīvi: mapping and measuring forests, farms and towns with consumer RGB drones"
type: software
version: 0.0.1
license: AGPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/Mraz11/Divi"
url: "https://github.com/Mraz11/Divi"
authors:
  # Put the name you publish under here before the first release (see docs/LICENSING.md).
  - family-names: "REPLACE_ME"
    given-names: "REPLACE_ME"
abstract: >-
  Flight planning for DJI Fly, photo checks, processing with WebODM, and
  quality-checked tree, canopy and land-cover measurements with stated
  uncertainty, for consumer RGB drones. Runs on the user's own computer.
keywords:
  - drone
  - photogrammetry
  - forestry
  - canopy height
  - biomass
  - remote sensing
